<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Instruments on Maciej Rogoż</title><link>https://rudgosz.github.io/tags/instruments/</link><description>Recent content in Instruments on Maciej Rogoż</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 12 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://rudgosz.github.io/tags/instruments/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Reconstruction of a Byzantine Lyre</title><link>https://rudgosz.github.io/posts/lyre/</link><pubDate>Fri, 12 May 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://rudgosz.github.io/posts/lyre/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;A handcrafted reconstruction of a historical Byzantine bowed string instrument inspired by the traditional instruments used by the folk group &lt;em&gt;Percival&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;a href="https://rudgosz.github.io/images/lyre/lyre.jpg" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;img src="https://rudgosz.github.io/images/lyre/lyre.jpg"&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;alt="multifx v2 PCB"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;p&gt;Fig. 1: Byzantine Lyre Replica.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 id="media--links"&gt;Media &amp;amp; Links&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Demo:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hkWeZtEZc-I&amp;amp;t=176s"&gt;Watch Byzantine Lyre Demo on YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Handcrafted Renaissance Lute</title><link>https://rudgosz.github.io/posts/lute/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Feb 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://rudgosz.github.io/posts/lute/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;A classical Renaissance stringed instrument designed and constructed entirely by hand from raw timber.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;a href="https://rudgosz.github.io/images/lute/lute.jpg" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;img src="https://rudgosz.github.io/images/lute/lute.jpg"&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;alt="multifx v2 PCB"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;p&gt;Fig. 1: Handcrafted Renaissance Lute.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 id="details"&gt;Details&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Custom acoustic design inspired by historical Renaissance lutes.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craftsmanship:&lt;/strong&gt; Hand-shaped body, neck, soundboard, and decorative rosette.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>